  "problem": "The Taylor series for the function $f(x)$ about $x=0$ is given by \n\n$$\nf(x)={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}{x}^{n}}{(2n+1)!}.\n$$\n\nFind the series expansion of ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }$\n{{field-1}}\n$(-1)^{n+1}{x}^{n-1}$",
